    Lines:
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: "Wash your hands at the basin before you climb. The stair keeps count of the careless."
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: "A shrine maiden, here? The hall is open to all who come quietly. Mind the third step from the top; it rocks."
